<title>UK: First Leisure pre-tax profit rises nine pct.</title>
<headline>First Leisure pre-tax profit rises nine pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to October 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		19.28		  vs 17.64</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.93		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 8.44		   vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     43.7		   vs 40.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   182.9		 vs 158.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 40 and 42.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - First Leisure Corp Plc.</p>
